meta = p["protocol_meta"]
meta["component"] = "EvidenceContract parsing (claim_carrier object shape incl. corpus address + rule), manifest validation at mint/write (recoverability: source corpus content-address + full rule, reject otherwise), EvidenceReadiness (carrier selection by comparator class), proposal envelope (separate diagnostics block for expansion_cost with carrier:false)"
meta["change"] = meta["change"] + "; v4: the declaration pins the source corpus content-address and the full selection rule, a manifest lacking them is rejected as non-recoverable, a mint citing another address is rejected, and expansion_cost moves to a separate diagnostics block with carrier:false, off the readiness card"
